35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The late-turn pool is hollow. Overtime covers everything. We cannot promise new services without breaking the existing schedule.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, your hollow pool is a symptom, not the cause. My stopwatch proves connections eat the time, not the platforms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, @Takumi, your operational worries are valid, but the ledger shows our ticketing fees now exceed resurfacing budgets. We are bleeding cash before we even start.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is vital, but history is wiser. The old pilots succeeded because we respected their scope. We must not repeat past overreach.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is cold, but the ground is unforgiving. Three recent jobs stalled on hidden voids. We must price that risk honestly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, symptoms require treatment. My data shows crews are a third below establishment. We cannot run new services without breaking the existing schedule.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, crews are a third below, but the stopwatch says connections are the real killer. We fix the timing, not the rumors.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, @Jonathan, scope and ground are real, but the ticketing fees are a silent tax. We are funding contractors, not infrastructure.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
